+	<p>' . __('CSV file, no heading row: customer code, status (normal, watch or stop), credit limit (optional), next review date as yyyy-mm-dd (optional).') . '</p>
+	<field><label for="StatusFile">' . __('File') . ':</label><input type="file" name="StatusFile" id="StatusFile" /></field>
